<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>血痢 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%A1%80%E7%97%A2/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 11:06:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%A1%80%E7%97%A2/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>正医法：论肺经生痈 论久嗽服气法 论水泻 论血痢 论水肿 论两胁胀满吞酸吐酸 论腰痛 论怔忡不寐</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-1-zhengyifa/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 10:50:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-1-zhengyifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BC%E9%9B%86/">卷一礼集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“正医法”部分，以岐天师、张仲景、雷公等人问答形式，论述五脏病证的正治与隔治之法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;除肺经外，诸脏可正治；肺为娇脏，不容药物，当转治脾、肝、心以间接养肺，此即“隔一隔二隔三”之治。各经病证，须明辨寒热虚实，审因论治&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>